          "value": "The lands of Magic are known for their beautiful sweeping landscapes and awe-inspiring exotic locales. Fie on that we say. Fie! Too long has gorgeous art gotten in the way of the most exciting part of the game: an extremely detailed rules system dictating exactly how to play! Featuring art by ABSOLUTELY NOBODY, these full-text lands are a deep dive into the inner machinery of basic lands. Express your love for rules and literally nothing else with the most informative lands the game has ever seen!\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Plains\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Island\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Swamp\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Mountain\r\n<br>• 1x Full-text Forest"
